@LiveOdds_HostAddress = http://localhost:5189

### 1. View Live Ticking Odds (Run twice 5 seconds apart to see odds shift!)
GET {{LiveOdds_HostAddress}}/api/events

###

### 2. Check Starting Wallet Balance (R10,000.00)
GET {{LiveOdds_HostAddress}}/api/wallets/angel_trader

###

### 3. Place Atomic Bet (R500.00 on Sharks HOME)
POST {{LiveOdds_HostAddress}}/api/bets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "angel_trader",
  "eventId": 1,
  "selection": "HOME",
  "stake": 500.00
}
